# Create the four Docker secret files before starting:
#
# openssl rand -hex 32 > infra/secrets/redis_password
# openssl rand -hex 32 > infra/secrets/centrifugo_http_api_key
# openssl rand -hex 32 > infra/secrets/centrifugo_proxy_secret
# openssl rand -hex 32 > infra/secrets/postgres_password
#
# Causal Memory receives its tenant map and server-owned distillation-model key
# only through these Docker secret files. Create them from the approved secret
# manager; never put actual values in this repository, an env example, logs, or
# command arguments.
# infra/secrets/coforge_causal_memory_tenant_tokens
# infra/secrets/coforge_causal_memory_distill_model_api_key
#
# Optional host ports remain configurable with CENTRIFUGO_PORT (default 8000),
# REDIS_PORT (default 6379), and CAUSAL_MEMORY_PORT (default 9938). Causal
# Memory binds to 127.0.0.1 locally; staging exposes no host port.
